          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "TRANSPORT TIME\n\nThis node outputs the amount of seconds, bars and beats that have passed  since the Transport has started.\n\nExample: We use de amount of bars passed for the Z (seed) of the Fractal Noise. This way our Fractal noise animates and will change speed with adjustment  to the BPM"
          }
